ouncilmember Wolfson, Councilmember Bozajian, and Councilmember Maurer expressed their appreciation for Mayor Groveman�s leadership.\r\rElection of Mayor and Mayor pro Tem.\r\rCouncilmember Wolfson moved, seconded by Councilmember Maurer to appoint Dennis Washburn as Mayor. MOTION CARRIED 5/0.\r\rMayor Washburn moved, seconded by Councilmember Wolfson to appoint James R. Bozajian as Mayor pro Tempore. MOTION CARRIED 5/0.\r\rOath of Office to Mayor and Mayor pro Tem by Judge Richard G. Kolostian.\r\rThe Honorable Richard G. Kolostian, Los Angeles Superior Court Judge, administered the Oath of Office to newly appointed Mayor Dennis Washburn and Mayor pro Tem James R. Bozajian.\r\rComments by Mayor.\r\r\u0013 SEQ CHAPTER \\h \\r 1\u0015Mayor Washburn commented on the City�s goals and visions for the next twelve months.\r\rADJOURN\r\r The City Council adjourned at 8:24 p.m.\r\r____________________________________ \rGwen Peirce, Assistant City Clerk\r\u0003\r\r\u0004\r\r\u0003\r\r\u0004\r\r\r\r\r\r\u0013PAGE \u0014- 2 -\u0015\r03/15/06\r\rA copy of the City Council agenda packet is available for review at City Hall and the Calabasas Library.\r\rThe City of Calabasas, in complying with the Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA), request individuals who require special accommodations to access, attend and/or participate in the City meeting due to disability, to please contact the City Clerk�s Office, (818) 878-4225, at least one business day prior to the scheduled meeting to insure that we may assist you.\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u